// =====================================================================
// Axos Standard Library: dag_lib.axos
// Canonical Directed Acyclic Graph Operations
// =====================================================================

HOW TO GRAPH nodes AND edges:
    WRITE "GRAPH " TO SCREEN
    WRITE nodes TO SCREEN
    WRITE " AND " TO SCREEN
    WRITE edges TO SCREEN

HOW TO MERGE source INTO destination:
    WRITE "MERGE " TO SCREEN
    WRITE source TO SCREEN
    WRITE " INTO " TO SCREEN
    WRITE destination TO SCREEN
